s&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ff56df7\" data-id=\"ff56df7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e4a952 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8e4a952\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"182\">To ensure the sustainability of the company, customer satisfaction, and the enhancement of knowledge, DEVLOP establishes the following principles:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01380a4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"01380a4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"352\">To meet customer needs by providing products and services that meet their expectations, aiming to establish a relationship of trust and loyalty with the DEVLOP brand.<\/li><li data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"467\">To explore market opportunities by offering innovative and effective solutions for both the customer and DEVLOP.<\/li><li data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"781\">To develop a culture of competence, quality, and innovation through the evaluation of the conformity of activities, fostering creativity, market, technological, and organizational monitoring, opportunity analysis, management and coordination of innovation projects, and the protection of intellectual knowledge.<\/li><li data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"906\">To invest in open and transparent communication, involving and aligning teams for processes and achieving planned results.<\/li><li data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1018\">To promote awareness and training for employees to strengthen their skills and improve their quality of life.<\/li><li data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1221\">To ensure the efficient use of resources and the incorporation of innovative technologies in the management of activities, minimizing non-value-added activities to ensure the company\u2019s sustainability.<\/li><li data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1275\">To establish partnerships aimed at mutual benefits.<\/li><li data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1405\">To comply with applicable legislation and regulations, as well as the requirements of the NP EN ISO 9001 and NP 4457 standards.<\/li><li data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1591\">To continuously improve the effectiveness of the management system through performance evaluation, the establishment of improvement actions, and the enhancement of acquired knowledge.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c42e67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2c42e67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1828\">DEVLOP thus positions itself as a socially responsible company, composed of a motivated, competent, and innovative team, committed to generating value for its customers, employees, shareholders, and, in general, for all stakeholders.<\/p><p data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1840\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">08-05-2023<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-96032f4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"96032f4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f170fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"7f170fc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Pol\u00edtica da Qualidade e Inova\u00e7\u00e3o To ensure the sustainability of the company, customer satisfaction, and the enhancement of knowledge, DEVLOP establishes the following principles: To meet customer needs by providing products and services that meet their expectations, aiming to establish a relationship of trust and loyalty with the DEVLOP brand. To explore market opportunities by [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/16146"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/3"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=16146"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/16146\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":16150,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/16146\/revisions\/16150"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=16146"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}